{"product_id":"refurbished-buture-jr700-red-cordless-vacuum","title":"Buture JR700 Red Vacuum | Official Refurbished","description":"\u003cp\u003eAt Buture, we're all about making cleaning easier and more efficient for you. Our wireless vacuums have been a hit, and we've been listening to user’s feedback to make them even better. Meet the JR700 Red, the latest and one of the finest cordless vacuums in our JR wireless vacuum series This model packs a powerful 500-watt motor, perfect for tackling pet hair and tough messes. Plus, it features an upgraded color touchscreen, up to 55 minutes of runtime, and a new tangle-free roller.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/cordless-vacuum-for-hard-wood-floor_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUnboxing the Buture JR700 Red\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Buture JR700 comes in a sleek, silver box, reflecting its modern design and high-quality construction. Inside the box, you will find:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMain body with dust cup\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFloor brush\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTelescopic tube\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrevice tool\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSmall cleaning brush\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery charger\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWall-mounted stand\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo additional HEPA filters(Total of three)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDesign and Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 stands out with its striking red color, a first for Buture's wireless cordless vacuum lineup. Its design is complemented by rating marks on the main body, telescopic tube, and floor brush, enhancing its sleek appearance. The football outlook design on the top serves as an air outlet, adding a modern touch to its functional design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/jr700-red-outlook-design_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUpgraded Touchscreen\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new color touchscreen on the JR700 provides real-time battery level monitoring, accurate to one percent increments. Users can easily adjust the suction power using the plus and minus buttons. The JR700 offers three suction modes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow: 18 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMedium: 30 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaximum: 45 kPa\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe screen also includes indicators for brush roller tangling and dust cup blockage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/JR700-red-wireless-vacuum-test-on-carpet_480x480.png?v=1722332896\" alt=\"\" style=\"float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eEnhanced Filtration System\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 features a multi-stage filtration system, including three HEPA filters that are washable and recommended to be replaced every three months. The dust cup has a generous capacity of 1.5 liters and includes a metal filter for additional filtration.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eAccessories and Practical Use\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe floor brush has been upgraded with hardened bristles integrated into a single tangle-free roller, making it effective on both carpets and hard floors. The V-shaped roller design ensures no hair tangling, ideal for pet owners.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe crevice tool and round brush attachments make cleaning hard-to-reach places easy. The telescopic tube adjusts from 440 to 680 millimeters, providing flexibility in use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eNoise Levels\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe JR700 operates quietly, below 68dB. This design choice ensures a more peaceful cleaning experience, allowing you to use the cordless vacuum without disturbing others in your household.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eLED Lights\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFour LED lights on the floor brush illuminate dark areas, ensuring you don't miss any spots while cleaning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe 7-cell removable battery has a capacity of 2200mAh, providing 55 minutes of runtime on low power mode and 20 minutes on high suction mode. This ensures you have ample time to clean your entire home on a single charge.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter testing the Buture JR700, it's clear that this model offers several upgrades over its predecessor, the JR600. With its powerful motor, enhanced touchscreen, and innovative design, the JR700 is a top choice for anyone seeking a reliable and efficient cordless vacuum cleaner. While it lacks the built-in dust sensor of the JR600, the JR700 more than makes up for it with its improved features and performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eButure JR700 Red Specification\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cstyle\u003e\n    .jr700-table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n        table-layout: fixed;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th, .jr700-table td {\n        border: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding: 8px;\n        text-align: left;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n    .jr700-table th {\n        background-color: #EE6819;\n        color: white;\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .jr700-table tr:nth-child(even) {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n\u003c\/style\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"width: 100%; height: 216.532px;\" height=\"384\" class=\"jr700-table\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"height: 20.5938px;\"\u003e\n\u003cth style=\"width: 46.875%; height: 20.5938px; text-align: left;\"\u003eFeature\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003cth style=